# spectre-kde -- wallpapers-config
# Per-monitor wallpaper assignments (macOS-style: different wallpaper per screen)
# Format: WALLPAPER_<screen>=<wallpaper-name-or-path>
# A screen number starting at 1 = primary/first screen; higher numbers are
# additional screens. An empty value clears that screen's override so it falls
# back to the default wallpaper (WAVY default).
#
# Default: the single wavy_lines_v02_5120x2880.png on every screen.

